## 4. New contract identity

```text
contractVersion: capability-bus-execute-action-outcome.v1
status: accepted
```

Boundary metadata:

```js
{
    outcome: "result-event-contract-only",
    executable: false,
    runtimeSettlement: "not-wired",
    runtimeWiring: "not-wired",
    nativeExecution: "not-wired"
}
```

The outcome descriptor embeds:

```text
action identity
boundary metadata
copy-isolated orchestration descriptor
optional normalized resultEnvelope
optional normalized actionEvent
metadata copied from backend adapter invocation identity/contract fields
```

---

## 5. Contract behavior

New constants/helpers:

```js
CAPABILITY_BUS_EXECUTE_ACTION_OUTCOME_CONTRACT_VERSION
CAPABILITY_BUS_EXECUTE_ACTION_OUTCOME_STATUS
CAPABILITY_BUS_EXECUTE_ACTION_OUTCOME_BOUNDARY
CAPABILITY_BUS_EXECUTE_ACTION_OUTCOME_EXECUTABLE
CAPABILITY_BUS_EXECUTE_ACTION_OUTCOME_RUNTIME_SETTLEMENT
CAPABILITY_BUS_EXECUTE_ACTION_OUTCOME_RUNTIME_WIRING
CAPABILITY_BUS_EXECUTE_ACTION_OUTCOME_NATIVE_EXECUTION
validateCapabilityBusExecuteActionOutcomeDescriptor(value)
normalizeCapabilityBusExecuteActionOutcomeDescriptor(value)
assertCapabilityBusExecuteActionOutcomeDescriptor(value)
copyCapabilityBusExecuteActionOutcomeDescriptor(value)
copyCapabilityBusExecuteActionOutcomeValue(value)
```

New outcome/event creators:

```js
createCapabilityBusExecuteActionAcceptedOutcome(orchestrationDescriptor, fields = {})
createCapabilityBusExecuteActionStartedOutcome(orchestrationDescriptor, fields = {})
createCapabilityBusExecuteActionCompletedOutcome(orchestrationDescriptor, fields = {})
createCapabilityBusExecuteActionFailedOutcome(orchestrationDescriptor, error, fields = {})
createCapabilityBusExecuteActionCancelledOutcome(orchestrationDescriptor, reasonOrError, fields = {})
createCapabilityBusExecuteActionTimeoutOutcome(orchestrationDescriptor, reasonOrError, fields = {})
createCapabilityBusExecuteActionPolicyDeniedOutcome(orchestrationDescriptor, reasonOrError, fields = {})
createCapabilityBusExecuteActionStreamDeltaEvent(orchestrationDescriptor, fields = {})
createCapabilityBusExecuteActionStreamDeltaOutcome(orchestrationDescriptor, fields = {})
```

Behavior:

```text
normalizes and validates accepted execute-action orchestration descriptors
creates accepted/running/completed/failed/cancelled/timeout/policy_denied result envelopes
creates accepted/started/stream.delta/completed/failed/cancelled/timeout/policyDenied action events
allows stream delta to remain event-only without inventing a stream result schema
requires non-executable / not-wired / contract-only boundary metadata
requires result/event action identity to match orchestration action identity
requires result/event status/type pairs to match when both are present
copies route/service/adapter/backend/model/profile IDs from backend invocation metadata
keeps event/result/orchestration payloads copy-isolated
rejects raw lower-level execution, executor skeleton, and backend invocation descriptors as direct outcome inputs
rejects forbidden runtime/worker/native/model-path/backend-execution keys in outcome-owned metadata
rejects unknown top-level, action, boundary, and metadata fields
```

The branch intentionally does not redesign `resultEnvelope.mjs` or `actionEvent.mjs`.

